    {"sourceType":"decision","reference":"ChatGPT conversation 2026-08-09","note":"Password Sign In behavior review resolved the category to Success, Rejected, and Locked Out. Invalid password and unknown account are permutations of Rejected with distinct internal audit evidence; lockout remains separate because it represents materially different state and next actions."},
    {"sourceType":"decision","reference":"ChatGPT conversation 2026-08-09","note":"Password Sign In scenario review approved two shared client navigation scenarios followed by one canonical server-submit scenario for Success, Rejected, or Locked Out. Rejected intentionally leaves expectedAuthLogEvents empty because invalid-password and unknown-account runtime proofs have different valid audit trails."},
    {"sourceType":"decision","reference":"ChatGPT conversation 2026-08-09","note":"Password Sign In presentation review retains the shared Welcome, Continue with Email, and Sign In with Password surfaces; maps Rejected to auth.sign-in.unable; introduces planned auth.sign-in.locked-out for lockout; keeps success host-directed; and removes Magic Link from the V2 password sign-in surface."}
